      {
        "calendar": "Gregorian",
        "value": "In 1848 he set out his view that history is the “history of class struggles” in the Manifesto of the Communist Party , written with Engels. It was a programmatic statement for the “Communist League”, a secret organisation of artisans, workers and intellectuals.",
